# vedio-11
Multi Container Pod Kubernetes - 
Sidecar vs Init Container:
Init Container is used for initialization tasks and runs before the main container starts. It stops after completing its job.

Sidecar Container runs alongside the main application container throughout the Pod's lifecycle and provides supporting functionality such as logging, monitoring, or proxy services.


