3. Kubernetes Self-Healing Experiment 🤖
Deployment banao:
kubectl create deployment nginx --image=nginx --replicas=3

Phir:
kubectl get pods
kubectl delete pod <pod-name>
kubectl get pods --watch
🔥 Observe karo Kubernetes automatically new Pod create karta hai.

